  "contentPlaintext": "<bold>Scope of Work (SOW)</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Client Organization:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Client Company Name]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Project Engagement Name:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Engagement Title]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Document Version:</textStyle></bold> 1.0.0-Baseline\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Effective Date:</textStyle></bold> May 28, 2026\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Project Lead:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Project Manager Name]\n<bold>1. Table of Contents</bold>\n1. Table of Contents\n2. Project Scope & Detailed Requirements\n2.1 Functional Requirements Matrix\n2.2 Out-of-Scope (Explicit Project Exclusions)\n3. Project Schedule & Milestone Deliverables\n3.1 Delivery Phases & Timeline Checkpoints\n4. Financial Terms, Budget & Billing Milestones\n4.1 Fixed-Fee Invoicing Schedule\n5. Project Governance & Change Control\n5.1 Communication Protocols & Service Level Agreements\n5.2 Formal Change Request Framework\n6. Authorization & Sign-Off\n<bold>2. Project Scope & Detailed Requirements</bold>\n<bold>2.1 Functional Requirements Matrix</bold>\nThis agreement binds the project team to deliver the following technical capabilities:\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Module 1 (Identity & Security):</textStyle></bold> Implementation of multi-factor user authentication and role-based access configurations.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Module 2 (Core Dashboard UI):</textStyle></bold> Delivery of a responsive frontend grid view interface that updates within <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">300 milliseconds</textStyle></bold>.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Module 3 (Data Pipeline Ingestion):</textStyle></bold> Construction of a secure ingestion pipeline to process batch payload inputs up to 25MB without performance drops.\n<bold>2.2 Out-of-Scope (Explicit Project Exclusions)</bold>\nAny capability not explicitly listed in Section 2.1 is excluded from this engagement cycle. Out-of-scope items include:\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Multi-Region Infrastructure Hosting:</textStyle></bold> Server configurations target a single cloud staging container; global cloud scaling is excluded.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Legacy Browser Optimizations:</textStyle></bold> Interface templates support modern evergreen browser layout engines only.\n<bold>3. Project Schedule & Milestone Deliverables</bold>\n<bold>3.1 Delivery Phases & Timeline Checkpoints</bold>\nThe delivery timeline maps deliverables directly to targeted calendar check dates:\nPhase ID\nMilestone Deliverable Title\nFunctional Scope Validation\nTarget Review Date\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">PH-01</textStyle></bold>\nDiscovery & Final Requirements\nBaselined feature definitions and architecture blueprints.\n[Insert Date]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">PH-02</textStyle></bold>\nUser Interface Prototypes\nHigh-fidelity interactive wireframes and design system components.\n[Insert Date]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">PH-03</textStyle></bold>\nStaging Beta Application\nFunctional backend routing connected to active interface views.\n[Insert Date]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">PH-04</textStyle></bold>\nProduction Launch & Code Handover\nZero-downtime deployment, code package transfer, and final sign-off.\n[Insert Date]\n<bold>4. Financial Terms, Budget & Billing Milestones</bold>\n<bold>4.1 Fixed-Fee Invoicing Schedule</bold>\nThe total budget for this engagement operates on a fixed-fee model. Invoices trigger upon delivery of specified project milestones:\nInvoice ID\nTarget Release Trigger\nTotal Billing Allocation\nPayment Terms Offset\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">INV-01</textStyle></bold>\nInitial Document Execution (Deposit)\n25% of Total Fee\nNet 15 Days from Receipt\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">INV-02</textStyle></bold>\nCompletion of Phase 2 (UI Prototypes)\n25% of Total Fee\nNet 15 Days from Receipt\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">INV-03</textStyle></bold>\nCompletion of Phase 3 (Staging Beta)\n25% of Total Fee\nNet 15 Days from Receipt\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">INV-04</textStyle></bold>\nCompletion of Phase 4 (Production Launch)\n25% of Total Fee\nNet 15 Days from Receipt\n<bold>5. Project Governance & Change Control</bold>\n<bold>5.1 Communication Protocols & Service Level Agreements</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Client Review Periods:</textStyle></bold> The Client has exactly <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">5 business days</textStyle></bold> to review deliverables and submit feedback loops. If no input is logged, the deliverable is deemed approved.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Response Response SLA:</textStyle></bold> Both parties agree to respond to direct communications and feedback-needed requests within <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">24 hours</textStyle></bold> on business days.\n<bold>5.2 Formal Change Request Framework</bold>\nIf the Client requests a change to the scope defined in Section 2.1, the project team will issue a formal Change Order detailing the target adjustment's impact on budget and delivery deadlines. No development work on out-of-scope components will begin without an authorized signature on the Change Order document.\n<bold>6. Authorization & Sign-Off</bold>\nBy signing below, both parties confirm acceptance of the scope parameters, delivery schedules, fee allocations, and governance guidelines outlined in this Scope of Work.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Project Provider Signature:</textStyle></bold> _____________________ (Date: __________)\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Client Partner Signature:</textStyle></bold> _____________________ (Date: __________)",
